   management system to adapt to the present situations of our country due
   to rapid urbanization and redevelopment of brownfields in recent years.
   In order to ensure environmental conditions for ``livable Chongqing{''}
   and ``healthy Chongqing{''}, suggestions for revising the present
   ``Environmental management measures of contaminated sites in
   Chongqing{''} were proposed in this paper based on fully analyzing the
