   Photogrammetry \& Remote Sensing; Grp Earth Observat; Int Soc Digital
   Earth; Chinese Acad Sci; Natl Remote Sensing Ctr China; LDE; REIS;
   LIESMARS; State Key Laboratory of Remote Sensing Science},
Abstract = {This paper is concerned with morphological change analysis in the old
   foreign concessions of Shanghai from 1969 to 2010. To that end, we use a
   series of 17 Landsat TM and Landsat ETM + images on which we estimate
   some feature parameters. The analysis of the resulting time series
   enables to isolate changes from traditional constructions to new
   buildings or gardens. Our results show that 70 \% of the old urban
   pattern was converted in modern high-rise buildings and green spaces.},
