   Buildings/3rd International Conference on Built Environment and Public
   Health, Guilin, PEOPLES R CHINA, MAY 29-31, 2009},
Organization = {Hunan Univ; Univ Hong Kong; Tsinghua Univ},
Abstract = {The outdoor unit of an air-conditioner used in building release a great
   deal of heat into outdoors while they improve the indoor thermal
   environment. And sometimes the outdoor units arranged unreasonably.
   Therefore, it will cause a rise in the outdoor air temperature and
   worsen the urban thermal environment. The Inlet temperatures and COP of
   five different arrangements of outdoor units in a building in Shanghai
   are calculated. The results demonstrate the maximum temperature
   difference of five arrangements is 2.95 degrees C and the COP difference
   is 11.1\%, which indicates the significance of reasonable outdoor units'
   arrangement.},
