Abstract = {This study, based on the learning environment researches, is focused on
   the dynamic of students' perceptions of teacher interpersonal behaviour
   in the classroom. Participants in this study were 525 Romanian students
   (11 - 19 years old, age mean = 14.34, SD = 2.24) from 23 classes (fifth
   to eleven). The data were colleted by the first Romanian translation of
   the Questionnaire on Teacher Interactions (Frazer, 1998). The research
   found significant differences in perceptions of the teachers, according
   to the students' gender, class membership, and transition pathway. The
   results are useful for intervention programs aiming to improve the
   quality of learning environment. (C) 2010 Elsevier Ltd. All rights
