   Acad Sci IR Iran; Latvian Acad Sci; Polish Acad Sci; Russian Acad Sci;
   Serbian Acad Sci \& Arts; Slovak Acad Sci; Natl Acad Sci Ukraine;
   Bulgarian Ind Assoc},
Abstract = {Building of roundabouts has many positive environmental and
   socio-economic benefits which can be monetized to express the financial
   value of positive effect they have on their environment. The article
   shows how the construction of roundabouts can lower the noise pollution
   created by traffic on urban intersections. The first chapter describes
   the basic definitions and description for the reader to grasp the basic
   knowledge needed to understand the main body of the paper. The main part
   describes the noise level reduction after reconstruction of selected
   intersection to roundabouts in selected cities of Slovak Republic and
   Czech Republic. In the last chapter a simple method of monetizing the
   benefits resulting from noise level reduction is shown. The objective of
   the article is to show the amount of noise based socio-economic benefits
   related to construction of roundabouts.},
