   undergraduate students at Faculty of Psychology and Educational
   Sciences, University of Bucharest. The participants are between 19 and
   23 years old (M=21.74; S.D=1.46). Instrument: FSV Questionnaire on
   Reaction to Pain (Vienna Test System, 2007). Findings confirmed the
