Note = {International Conference on Engineering Application, Physics and
   Sciences (ICEAPS), Johor Bahru, MALAYSIA, OCT 26-27, 2017},
Abstract = {This research aims to identify some factors affecting the buying
   decision in Giant Supermarket. It is based on a problem happening in
   Giant Supermarket related to some decreases which are in sales volume,
   top brand index, brand value, brand share, and the number of outlets in
   giant supermarket. This study is conducted in Giant Supermarket in
   Semarang. Six hypothesis had been formulated on this paper. By using 150
   respondents, the hypothesis were tested. Structural Equation Model (SEM)
   was employed to analyze the collected data. The result shows that the
   sales performance can be increased when the impulse buying of the
   customers is increased. The impulse buying increases if the supermarket
   can make interesting price discount. So, the price discount should be
   made.},
